---
import TemplateLayout from "../../layouts/TemplateLayout.astro";

const NAME = "The Operating Prompts™";
const PRICE = "$19";
const NOTE = "one-time";
const DEST = "https://links.thedigitalincomeedit.com/shop/607fd173-9065-49f3-9a69-7b18ac2b5876";
const AFF = false;
---
<TemplateLayout title={NAME} stickyHref={DEST} stickyLabel={PRICE === "$0" ? "Get it free" : `Get it · ${PRICE}`} heroBuy=".go .go-btn" description="The prompts that actually run my business. Thirty-four of them, strict on purpose, built on your own Brand Card.">
  <section class="sec wash go2"><div class="wrap"><div class="card dash go"><svg class="spk" style="position:absolute;right:-22px;top:-22px"><use href="#sp"/></svg>
    <div class="kick">{AFF ? "Recommended · Not mine" : "From the shop"}</div>
    <h1>{NAME}</h1>
    <p class="go-lede">The prompts that actually run my business. Thirty-four of them.</p>

    <div class="go-meta">
      <span class="go-price">{PRICE}</span>
      {NOTE && <span class="go-note">{NOTE}</span>}
    </div>

    <div class="go-body">
      <p>Somewhere there's a pack of hundreds of prompts with your name on it. You'll use four. These are the ones I actually run: the community, the classroom, the emails, the shop pages, the faceless Instagram account, and the audits that keep all of it from drifting.</p>
      <p>They're strict on purpose. They tell the AI what to refuse, and they stop when something's missing instead of guessing. The first one builds your Brand Card, so every prompt after it runs on your business, not mine.</p>
      <p>Inside: The Foundation, Content &amp; Social, Faceless Visuals, Skool Community, Email, Selling and Audits. 49 pages. Copy, paste, run. Membership Premium members already have it in The Premium Vault.</p>
    </div>

    {AFF && (
      <p class="go-disc">
        Affiliate link — I earn a commission if you buy through it, at no cost to you.
        I only recommend things I use. The price is set by the owner and can change without notice.
      </p>
    )}

    <a class="btn buy go-btn" href={DEST} rel={AFF ? "sponsored noopener" : "noopener"}>
      Get The Operating Prompts™ for {PRICE} <span class="ar">→</span>
    </a>

    <p class="go-back"><a href="/shop">← Everything in the shop</a></p>
  </div></div></section>
</TemplateLayout>
